<title>SPAIN: Repsol 1996 net 119.01 bln ptas, up 1.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Repsol 1996 net 119.01 bln ptas, up 1.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996 results for Spain's Repsol in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net attributable		   119.01	vs    117.72</p>
<p> Pretax profit			187.90	vs    188.90</p>
<p> Operating profit		   197.23	vs    212.50</p>
<p> Financial losses		    (8.23)     vs    (16.57)</p>
<p> Extraordinary losses		(1.11)     vs     (7.04)</p>
<p> Earnings per share (ptas)	 396.7	vs     392.38</p>
<p>NOTE: Repsol said these figures are a provisional estimate of 1996 results. The firm plans to release a full breakdown later today.</p>
</text>
